// sub-256 line .oo files within a directory, the directory MUST contain
// a mod.oo file. mod.oo serves as the single public entry door."
//
// Survey: 35 of 37 first-level subdirectories originally lacked mod.oo.
// Only fmt/ and net/ had it. This is a systemic Pillar 6 violation.
//
